ts of the Round Table, a man called the Strongest of Knights. He looks aloof at first glance, yet is calm and thoughtful. He is there to support the heroine when she gets a bumpy start to her life at the castle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He keeps his left arm bandaged, but it doesn't seem to be due to any wound. He wouldn't let anyone see beneath the bandages."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"With this...I can always carry on winning for your sake.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30276"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/0130d24d7fd1ccef643a9861f297c44a7239b8dc8a5c227a3f76ad8a7c1d3711.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/3948170642cc002af2ec942142f89bcedf11f4e0327e89e819b3bd7f8e7b44cd.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野 友樹","creatorId":"vndb:s42","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s42","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s42","name":"小野 友樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48995","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30277","characterName":"ガウェイン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30277"},"originalCharacterName":"ガウェイン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A knight with fiery red hair and eyes, and a fiery spirit to match. He wields a greataxe, and while he can be blunt and ill-mannered, at least you always know exactly where you stand with him. He opens up to the heroine relatively quickly. He lost his two younger sisters in battle once, which led to him growing fixated with achieving the title of \"Strongest.\" This has given him a bit of an inferiority complex with regards to Lancelot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I'll have to beat everything, if I want to keep anyone from laying a finger on you.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30277"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1597b19486067d6479d9ef299d0cd58bb81d38ad62e0b1d4d8da80fe6d361e01.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fbabce502898dc1abc05456f8e231be4e3a5019bf93986a9d1a6d8df09be3ddf.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷山 紀章","creatorId":"vndb:s59","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s59","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s59","name":"谷山 紀章","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48996","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30278","characterName":"トリスタン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30278"},"originalCharacterName":"トリスタン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A veteran knight that has lived through many a battle. He specializes in wielding the longsword and bow, and he treats any perceived enemy with what might be called ruthlessness. He is the longest-serving among the Knights of the Round Table, and he is highly unimpressed with this upstart peasant girl trying to be a king."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"You hardly know the first thing about me, just as I barely know you.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30278"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/986bfda61671c82eeff280ac4756feaad1dbbaa1f9e2e5e9294d5eb295c75f20.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a22520e2d7c70f7355b87b1a852cf9b99cb3464be11b5b6a6a6ab6c00cdc5f84.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"子安 武人","creatorId":"vndb:s10","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10","name":"子安 武人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48992","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30279","characterName":"ガラハッド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30279"},"originalCharacterName":"ガラハッド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The youngest of the Knights of the Round Table, a genius knight with top-notch sword and bow skills. He has gorgeous features that make him easily mistaken for a woman. He was born with a silver spoon in his mouth, so to speak, and he has extremely low regard for others besides himself. Phrases such as \"I just don't care if I die\" spring easily from his lips."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Where's the fun in learning about someone else, really?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30279"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8312c19ceec1e23872b66936e5870a75560bd3565530771ca522127cc605ca6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a325941f6a857ae71e3ef96991b42412f17e290eaa2804e78b1223a45f1d652.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本 信彦","creatorId":"vndb:s550","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s550","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s550","name":"岡本 信彦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49001","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30280","characterName":"モードレッド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30280"},"originalCharacterName":"モードレッド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A flashy knight that specializes in dual-wielding swords. He always has a ready smile and an ear for others, but he is also occasionally prone to provocative outbursts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He acts as though he is indulging the heroine from the very start, but sometimes his demeanor comes across as artificial. He can be very difficult to get a read on."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Rest assured, I won't expect you to wake up tomorrow loving me?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30280"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/0403533a6fdac2464ff2273a2b7025882e9afc9b6c95ff154f0c8eca475ed7df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/599b32d88a37d094e2bb2133b5ce5b5600d56393378c9c722fbfd6c4bf933956.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"細谷 佳正","creatorId":"vndb:s251","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s251","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s251","name":"細谷 佳正","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:48999","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30281","characterName":"マーリン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30281"},"originalCharacterName":"マーリン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A legendary wizard who has served the castle for generations. His incredible power and prophetic actions draw the heroine's attention...except the lion's share of his time is more devoted to mocking pickup lines and naughty behavior. Truly a man of mystery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"If you won't run, I'll just tackle you to the floor right here and now, you know.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd07df7b55e9467221305edf9bce662174c041055f50dabbdaf5e6ab5662416c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e7dcb84c439b408b0efa8a4f1f340049c9d551bbe02e499637e217c267fe3f73.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"置鮎 龍太郎","creatorId":"vndb:s747","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s747","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s747","name":"置鮎 龍太郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49003","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30282","characterName":"ボールス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30282"},"originalCharacterName":"ボールス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A member of the Knights of the Round Table."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30282"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb750ad9319b1e7f0e4852d31728fbff4f110c42fbac4d2539fbaf93e37bbef9.webp","fallbackUrl":"http